  "ruleText": "Saf-C 305.08 Prosecution. Nothing contained in these rules shall preclude the department from seeking criminal prosecution, under RSA 638:4, of any person who has issued a bad check.\n\nSource. #4207, eff 1-16-87; ss by #4451, eff 6-24-88; ss by #4844, eff 6-20-90; ss by #6249, INTERIM, eff 6-16-96, EXPIRES: 10-14-96; ss and moved by #6337, eff 9-25-96 (formerly Saf-C 210.04); ss by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13; ss by #12520, eff 4-25-18 (formerly Saf-C 211.04) ); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (See Revision Note #3 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300)",
